@startuml

actor Visitor

participant "Public Interface" as UI
participant "AI Query Service" as AI
participant "Product MCP" as PMCP
participant "Stock MCP" as SMCP
participant "Product API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Visitor -> UI :
Type a question

UI -> AI :
POST /questions

AI -> PMCP :
get_product_details(product)

PMCP -> API :
GET /products/{id}

API --> PMCP :
Product JSON

PMCP --> AI :
Product details

AI -> SMCP :
find_branches_with_stock(product, quantity)

SMCP -> DB :
SELECT stock

DB --> SMCP :
Stock rows

SMCP --> AI :
Matching branches

AI --> UI :
JSON response

UI --> Visitor :
Display answer

@enduml